{"kind": "daily", "date": "2026-07-25", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-07-25</div>\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Google Rushes Emergency Chrome 150 Update to Patch Four High-Risk Flaws<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google緊急更新Chrome 150版，修補4個高風險漏洞</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google shipped Chrome 150.0.7871.181/182 this week, then abruptly released 150.0.7871.186/187 for Windows/macOS plus a Linux build just two days later to fix additional vulnerabilities.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">本週Google發布Chrome 150穩定版後，兩天內又緊急釋出新版本，針對Windows、macOS與Linux平台修補4個高風險漏洞。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/177624\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Anthropic Launches Claude Opus 5, Prioritizing Token Efficiency Over Raw Capability<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic推出Opus 5，主打Token效率而非能力躍進</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic released Opus 5, saying it comes close to Fable 5's capabilities while being cheaper and less restrictive; reviewers note the update is more about efficiency than a big capability leap.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic發布新模型Opus 5，宣稱效能接近Fable 5，且價格更低、限制更少；分析認為此次更新著重Token效率而非重大能力突破。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/07/24/anthropic-launches-opus-5/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Hands-On With OpenAI's New AI Keypad: Fun for Coders, Puzzling for Everyone Else<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">實測OpenAI新款AI鍵盤：對部分工程師有趣，對其他人卻很陌生</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI's new physical AI keypad accessory delighted some developers during hands-on testing, but its purpose left many other users confused.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI推出的實體AI鍵盤配件讓部分開發者玩得盡興，但對一般使用者而言，用途卻顯得相當難以理解。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/07/24/i-tried-out-openais-new-ai-keypad-which-will-be-fun-for-coders-and-slightly-mystifying-to-everyone-else/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Why Cognition Bought Poke: AI Personality Becomes a Competitive Edge<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Cognition為何收購Poke：AI個性成為新的競爭優勢</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Cognition's acquisition of Poke brings its conversational style and interaction model into coding agent Devin, reflecting a growing belief that assistant personality matters as much as raw model power.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Cognition收購Poke，將其對話風格與互動模式帶入旗下程式代理Devin，反映業界愈發重視AI助理「個性」的重要性，不亞於模型本身能力。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/07/24/why-cognition-bought-poke-ai-personality-is-becoming-a-competitive-advantage/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Meta Upgrades Its AI Chatbot Into a Productivity Assistant<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Meta升級AI聊天機器人，朝生產力助理邁進</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Meta is adding calendar integration, daily briefings, and steerable deep research to Meta AI, aiming to compete more directly with Gemini, ChatGPT, and Claude.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Meta為Meta AI新增行事曆整合、每日簡報與可自訂深度研究功能，企圖與Gemini、ChatGPT和Claude在生產力助理市場正面競爭。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/tech/970570/meta-ai-chatbot-productivity-update\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Trump Administration Directs $5 Billion to AI-Driven Science Under 'Genesis Mission'<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">川普政府「創世任務」計畫撥款50億美元投入AI科學研究</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The White House unveiled its first Genesis Mission grants, funneling $5 billion toward hundreds of AI-driven science projects in an initiative it compares in scale to the Manhattan Project.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">白宮公布首批「創世任務」補助案，將50億美元投入數百個AI驅動的科學研究專案，官方將其規模比擬為曼哈頓計畫。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/science/970534/genesis-mission-ai-science-funding-trump-grants\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Google Hit With $1 Billion in EU Fines Amid Looming Trump Trade Battle<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google遭歐盟開罰10億美元，川普政府貿易對抗一觸即發</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google became the third tech giant fined under the EU's Digital Markets Act, as Brussels braces for potential retaliation from the Trump administration.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google成為第三家依歐盟《數位市場法》遭罰款的科技巨頭，而布魯塞爾也正嚴陣以待川普政府可能的反制措施。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/tech-policy/2026/07/google-hit-with-1-billion-in-fines-as-eu-braces-for-trump-battle/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Researchers Use AlphaFold to Redesign Gene-Editing Proteins for Greater Safety<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">研究團隊借助AlphaFold重新設計基因編輯蛋白，提升安全性</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A research team used Google's AlphaFold AI to identify which parts of gene-editing proteins are prone to causing errors, paving the way for safer redesigns.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">研究團隊利用Google的AlphaFold AI，找出基因編輯蛋白中容易導致錯誤的部位，為更安全的蛋白質重新設計鋪路。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/science/2026/07/team-uses-alphafold-ai-to-redesign-gene-editing-proteins-to-make-them-safer/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Claude Desktop Flaw Let Malicious Links Trigger Hidden Commands, Risking Chat Leaks<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Claude桌面版漏洞讓惡意連結自動送出隱藏指令，恐洩漏對話並植入程式碼</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Security firm Oasis Security disclosed a flaw dubbed PromptFiction in Anthropic's Claude Desktop app, letting crafted links trigger hidden commands without user confirmation; Anthropic has since patched it.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">資安業者Oasis Security揭露Claude桌面版存在名為PromptFiction的漏洞，特製連結可在使用者未確認下觸發隱藏指令，Anthropic已完成修補。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/177608\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Google's Gemini Nears a Billion-User Milestone<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google Gemini用戶數即將突破10億大關</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Gemini surpassed 750 million monthly users as of February and is closing in on the billion-user mark, matching the scale of Google's other flagship products.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Gemini今年2月月活躍用戶已超過7.5億，正逐步逼近10億大關，規模直追Google其他旗艦產品。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/07/23/google-closes-in-on-another-billion-user-product-with-gemini/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}